# Input
```jsx
// Spacing with standard equivalents
<div class="m-[1rem]" />;
<div class="p-[16px]" />;
<div class="px-[32px]" />;
<div class="mt-[0.5rem]" />;
<div class="gap-[24px]" />;

// Width/height with standard equivalents
<div class="w-[100%]" />;
<div class="h-[100vh]" />;
<div class="w-[50%]" />;
<div class="min-h-[100%]" />;

// Opacity with standard equivalents
<div class="opacity-[0.5]" />;
<div class="opacity-[0.75]" />;
<div class="opacity-[0]" />;
<div class="opacity-[1]" />;

// Font size with standard equivalents
<div class="text-[0.875rem]" />;
<div class="text-[16px]" />;
<div class="text-[1.5rem]" />;

// Border radius with standard equivalents
<div class="rounded-[0.5rem]" />;
<div class="rounded-[9999px]" />;
<div class="rounded-[0px]" />;

// Z-index with standard equivalents
<div class="z-[10]" />;
<div class="z-[50]" />;
<div class="z-[auto]" />;

// ==========================================
// Negative values with standard equivalents
// (should suggest dash-prefix form)
// ==========================================
<div class="m-[-1rem]" />;
<div class="mt-[-16px]" />;
<div class="mx-[-32px]" />;
<div class="top-[-1rem]" />;
<div class="left-[-16px]" />;
<div class="translate-x-[-1rem]" />;
<div class="translate-y-[-16px]" />;
<div class="z-[-10]" />;
<div class="indent-[-1rem]" />;

// With variants
<div class="hover:m-[1rem]" />;
<div class="dark:md:p-[16px]" />;
<div class="focus:opacity-[0.5]" />;
<div class="hover:m-[-1rem]" />;
<div class="dark:top-[-16px]" />;

// Multiple arbitrary values in one class string
<div class="m-[1rem] p-[16px] w-[100%]" />;
<div class="m-[-1rem] translate-x-[-16px]" />;

// ==========================================
// With important modifier (prefix)
// ==========================================
<div class="!m-[1rem]" />;
<div class="!p-[16px]" />;
<div class="!m-[-1rem]" />;
<div class="hover:!m-[1rem]" />;
<div class="hover:!m-[-1rem]" />;

// ==========================================
// With important modifier (suffix)
// ==========================================
<div class="m-[1rem]!" />;
<div class="p-[16px]!" />;
<div class="m-[-1rem]!" />;
<div class="hover:m-[1rem]!" />;
<div class="hover:m-[-1rem]!" />;

```

